# Open-work inventory

`docs/open-work.md` is the unfinished roadmap. Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

## Before claiming done

If the change adds, finishes, or defers roadmap work, edit `docs/open-work.md` in the same change.

## How to edit

- **Not implemented**: code still missing.
- **Awaiting verification**: code exists and has not been verified yet.
- When an item passes, delete the bullet.
